Homepage: https://github.com/603Madison/SuperAwesomeMagicalBrowser
Description: Firefox with your tabs down the side, in the SuperAwesomeMagical look
 SuperAwesomeMagical Browser is Mozilla Firefox (unmodified, as Mozilla releases
 it) with the SuperAwesomeMagical family's look: Lexend everywhere, the aurora's
 purple and green over cool slate, soft rounded cards, tabs down the left, and a
 start page with a big clock over the northern lights.
 .
 It keeps its own profile, so it never mixes with a separately installed
 Firefox.
